  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improving access to the critical needs of most vulnerable ( PWDs, older persons , children and women at risk ) IDPs and hosting communities through integrated humanitarian action in Guchi woreda of Borena zone, Oromia region.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To improve the physical and mental wellbeing of 35,862(19,414 female&amp; 16,448 male) IDPs and communities in Guchi Woreda through integrated Protection, Education and WASH activities.</narrative>
  </description>
